          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'Under the international Harmonized System (WCO), motorized adult vibrators and battery massagers are classified under HS Code 8509.80 (Electromechanical domestic appliances with self-contained electric motor). For the US, the 10-digit code is 8509.80.5045.'
